fixture cam_teleport_down_fall
doc Camera review round 2: jump off a shelf's end, throw the ember straight down at the apex, air-jump back onto the shelf, run back along it, teleport down to the ember hanging in the air and fall on
room test/cam_open
spawn 600 640
frames 260
input
  0..14 R jump
  15 D toss
  16..21 L
  22 L jump
  23..40 L jump
  41..120 L
  121 toss
end
expect
  at 15 event.toss=1
  at 121 event.teleport=1
end
